purpose: >
  Integration-test binaries for elohim-storage — the tier that exercises what
  `cargo test --lib` cannot (multi-component seams: distribute/selection with
  captured command channels, schema contracts, sweep harnesses). Considered
  2026-07-24: no edit-time gate warranted. The real gates are structural — the
  pre-push hook runs these binaries (it caught the custody-announce contract
  change the lib suite missed, same day), and test-edit discipline is owned by
  review + the never-edit-the-judge shift rule, which no declarative predicate
  can express. Tests here assert BEHAVIORAL CONTRACTS: when a deliberate design
  change breaks one, strengthen the assertion into a positive spec of the new
  contract (see distribute_shards_diversity's custody-announce evolution) —
  never loosen it to pass.
