# elohim-storage/tests — integration-tier contracts

Rules-free considered-coverage claim. Conventions: in-memory pools per test,
`for_testing_capturing_commands` harnesses, `#[ignore]` for live-swarm needs
(remember: `#[ignore]` is a CI no-op in DNA sweettests, but these are NOT
sweettests — plain cargo test respects it here).
